<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/>
<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/></TAB></TXT><BRK/>
<TXT>Control valves not meeting these face to face dimensions must be supplied with spacers suitable for the proper 
installation of the valve.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Flanges</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Per SME direction.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT><TAB>
<WBK>
   <STS/>
   <TDA COLUMNCOUNT="2" ROWCOUNT="5">
      <COL AUTOWIDTH="0" WIDTH="289.50"/>
      <COL AUTOWIDTH="0" WIDTH="167.25"/>
